With these two small edits:

- **LHError** no longer binds itself to an untranslated template ID out of the gate.
- **printRuntimeErrorAndExit** will only call `str_` after you’ve gone through Lighthouse’s normal i18n setup path, recovering proper English (or user‐selected locale) messaging instead of raw IDs.
